SUMMARY:🎬 JACKASS: BEST AND LAST – Opening Weekend Movie Meetup! 🤘
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎬 JA
 CKASS: BEST AND LAST – Opening Weekend Movie Meetup! 🤘\n\nJoin us thi
 s Friday\, June 26\, for the brand-new Jackass movie at Scotiabank Theatre
 !\n📅 Date: Friday\, June 26\n🕖 Showtime: 7:50 PM\n📍 Location: Sco
 tiabank Theatre Toronto\n⏰ Meet Time: 7:35 PM at the top of the escalato
 rs\, look for Nick and the Meetup sign\n\nThe Jackass crew is back one fin
 al time with *Jackass: Best and Last*\, the farewell installment to a fran
 chise that has entertained audiences for more than 25 years. Featuring new
  outrageous stunts\, classic never-before-seen footage\, and appearances f
 rom fan-favorite cast members\, the film serves as a celebration of the fr
 iendships\, chaos\, and unforgettable moments that made Jackass a cultural
  phenomenon. The cast has stated this is intended to be the final chapter\
 , making it a must-see event for longtime fans. ([Reuters](https://www.reu
 ters.com/business/media-telecom/older-not-wiser-jackass-crew-reunite-final
 -emotion-filled-film-2026-06-15/?utm_source=chatgpt.com "Older\, not wiser
  'Jackass' crew reunite for final emotion-filled film"))\n\n🎥 Runtime: 
 Approximately 1 hour 44 minutes. ([Reddit](https://www.reddit.com/r/boxoff
 ice/comments/1ttu2bs/according_to_amc_theaters_jackass_best_and_last/?utm_
 source=chatgpt.com "According to AMC Theaters\, Jackass: Best and Last has
  a runtime of 1 hour and 44 minutes."))\n🎞 Trailer:\n[https://www.youtu
 be.com/watch?v=sNwzFhGwA94&t=18s](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sNwzFhGw
 A94&t=18s)\n\n🎟 Tickets:\nPurchase online or at the box office:\n[https
 ://www.cineplex.com](https://www.cineplex.com/)\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT:\n• 
 Please post your seat number in the comments after purchasing your ticket 
 so others can sit nearby.\n• I will meet everyone at the top of the esca
 lators before the movie.\n• I will only wait 5 minutes before heading in
 side.\n• I'll be wearing blue jeans and a red polo shirt.\n• All regis
 tered attendees will have my phone number.\n\nNot sure if your schedule is
  free yet? That's okay—feel free to show up at the last minute if seats 
 are still available.\nExpect laughs\, cringe-worthy stunts\, and one last 
 chance to experience Jackass on the big screen with fellow fans. See you t
 here!
